  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KU &amp; BAVICHA - Movement4Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KU and BAVICHA have a successful history of working together, and now we are ready to take the next steps in our cooperation with this partnership project. In 2024 BAVICHA is going to host their big national congress that takes place every fifth year. Here, they are going to elect a new national leadership for the next five years. This also set some new demands for the next leadership because they are going to face new challenges. On a regional and local level BAVICHA is going to change the leadership more frequently. In a country with many different cultures and a struggling democracy it is important that you develop some skills, so you know how to deal with these issues. This project however has a focus on conflict management, organizational building, and empowering young women in politics in Tanzania.</narrative>
  </description>
